{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use your brush to draw the path to survival!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a creative physics-based drawing battle game. Your &quot;weapon&quot; isn't just a sword, but the brush in your hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you control a cute little bean by drawing movement trajectories to dictate its actions and attacks, embarking on a volatile adventure in a land filled with hordes of diverse monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/14e6ea27249757513f7dbc38b58dadc5.poster.avif?t=1768919456\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/14e6ea27249757513f7dbc38b58dadc5.webm?t=1768919456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/14e6ea27249757513f7dbc38b58dadc5.mp4?t=1768919456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-draw Your Path: Pre-draw a path, and the little bean will move along your drawn lines to launch attacks. Each trajectory you design is a new adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Arsenal &amp; Foes: Dozens of weapons and items to choose from, with a wide variety of monsters that grow increasingly powerful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to Learn, Hard to Master: Simple and intuitive controls make it easy to pick up in seconds, but truly mastering the strategy of each advance and retreat is the real challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the Waves: Each enemy assault wave continues until all action points are used up. Find a way to eliminate as many enemies as you can and survive during this time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and Equip: Collect experience to level up and gather coins to buy weapons and equipment in the shop.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pass Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/3ced540b4979a2f60905db826c572b6f808b02f4.jpg"},{"name":"Pass Level 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/fcf6f5cc7c65777934836c27a208d294b9c5cf95.jpg"},{"name":"Pass Level 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/4ed5f46f126dc1f8afced0579624572b8850987f.jpg"},{"name":"Pass Level 15","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/445e34fb19c34b0b699e7672450fcb992535f9be.jpg"},{"name":"Pass Level 20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/dc8847678e76579f94bfdd3a59ba90e1789b1fd0.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat 100 Enemies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/c6416e1a81e4ca968a313589e4149071fd7eae97.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat 300 Enemies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/ca5354f82ea633eced34a3dcac706ebd32628542.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat 500 Enemies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/71039d906a603e331710ad6d1afe56995e73f431.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat 1000 Enemies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/0316edc6653cac85c08473cabdde8000dee252cc.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat 3000 Enemies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3886770/5ab6a93a5f4b73e1ff2554f286b5d7e9f5ec5089.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886770?t=1768919456","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/f18b66c9c9dff1267cfa681f5e168a36a064df5d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768919456","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/98a14bbc5c37f2b94b143e7edb78217bd968a9da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768919456","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/98a14bbc5c37f2b94b143e7edb78217bd968a9da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768919456","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3928210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use your brush to draw the path to survival!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a creative physics-based drawing battle game. Your &quot;weapon&quot; isn't just a sword, but the brush in your hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you control a cute little bean by drawing movement trajectories to dictate its actions and attacks, embarking on a volatile adventure in a land filled with hordes of diverse monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/14e6ea27249757513f7dbc38b58dadc5.poster.avif?t=1768919456\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/14e6ea27249757513f7dbc38b58dadc5.webm?t=1768919456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/14e6ea27249757513f7dbc38b58dadc5.mp4?t=1768919456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-draw Your Path: Pre-draw a path, and the little bean will move along your drawn lines to launch attacks. Each trajectory you design is a new adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Arsenal &amp; Foes: Dozens of weapons and items to choose from, with a wide variety of monsters that grow increasingly powerful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to Learn, Hard to Master: Simple and intuitive controls make it easy to pick up in seconds, but truly mastering the strategy of each advance and retreat is the real challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the Waves: Each enemy assault wave continues until all action points are used up. Find a way to eliminate as many enemies as you can and survive during this time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and Equip: Collect experience to level up and gather coins to buy weapons and equipment in the shop.</p></li></ul>","developers":["RoeBox"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/ee328292d52ed141e3e64c0b5911a706c0c7d0f2/header.jpg?t=1768919456","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3886770/81481270/b8f5a3094b74a7bdb49f5df308693ef72413d179/1765114464/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765116831","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3886770/81481270/b8f5a3094b74a7bdb49f5df308693ef72413d179/1765114464/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765116831","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3886770/81481270/b8f5a3094b74a7bdb49f5df308693ef72413d179/1765114464/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765116831","id":257171729,"name":"Gameplay Demonstration Video","thumbnail"